  "scientific_conclusion": "NIST20 falsifies the claim that the current CASMI-2016-frozen consensus/gate reliably improves MRR across a third domain. There is nevertheless evidence of rank-redistribution signal: some moderate/hard queries move upward, while easy/high-value queries are sometimes damaged. The next model should explicitly protect high-confidence static hits and reconsider the energy-spread term, then be validated on a new untouched domain."
